WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.500 --> 00:00:05.000
Lesson 9.1 · Financial Management
Finance roles and the finance cycle

2
00:00:05.600 --> 00:00:11.800
Decide who does, records and oversees your money before the first payment.

3
00:00:13.000 --> 00:00:15.600
1. Separate doing, recording and overseeing, even in a team of two.

4
00:00:15.600 --> 00:00:18.200
2. Talk to a qualified accountant before you register.

5
00:00:18.200 --> 00:00:22.200
3. Put monthly and annual finance dates in your calendar now.

6
00:00:22.800 --> 00:00:24.600
You write your finance roles and your monthly and annual cycle.

7
00:00:24.600 --> 00:00:28.600
Then save it, and download it as a PDF.

8
00:00:30.100 --> 00:00:33.200
Method into Impact
Better foundations. Stronger organisations.
